{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you know nothing about wilderness survival, you'll learn the basics of staying alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate by the stars, the sun, the wind, or with a map and compass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/1fa805ccc06a95f2902d2e95e584f1c2.poster.avif?t=1772121539\" width=420 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/1fa805ccc06a95f2902d2e95e584f1c2.webm?t=1772121539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/1fa805ccc06a95f2902d2e95e584f1c2.mp4?t=1772121539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camp by night, hike by day. Gather what you need and keep moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/4f5fe41b414dd0184755e2190bf48ef3.poster.avif?t=1772121539\" width=428 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/4f5fe41b414dd0184755e2190bf48ef3.webm?t=1772121539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/4f5fe41b414dd0184755e2190bf48ef3.mp4?t=1772121539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forage for food as you cross different wilderness routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/d016b363db93388f3f3f452930f41f35.poster.avif?t=1772121539\" width=450 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/d016b363db93388f3f3f452930f41f35.webm?t=1772121539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/d016b363db93388f3f3f452930f41f35.mp4?t=1772121539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use what the land provides to take care of yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/742224ce0fffd51c238b3f305b6d6d56.poster.avif?t=1772121539\" width=484 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/742224ce0fffd51c238b3f305b6d6d56.webm?t=1772121539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/742224ce0fffd51c238b3f305b6d6d56.mp4?t=1772121539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each journey unlocks new skills, knowledge, and equipment, preparing you for new routes and challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to know the moment the demo or full game is ready? <strong>Add Survival Tech to your wish list</strong> and you\u2019ll get a heads-up as soon as it goes live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Disclaimer:\u00a0This game is for educational and entertainment purposes only. It is not a substitute for professional survival training. Real-world survival situations are unpredictable and potentially dangerous.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3